    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS AND VALUERS are proud to bring this beautiful property to the market, with little or nothing to be done, except move in!! You now have the potential to view and own this charming four-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached home, ideally located in the heart of Douglas.\r\nSituated in a sought-after residential area, the property is within easy reach of a wide range of essential amenities, local shops, schools, and public transport links, making it a wonderfully convenient place to call home.\r\n\r\nAlthough the property dates back to the 1960's it has been exceptionally well cared for over the years and requires only minimal modernisation to bring it in line with today's style and tastes. A fresh coat of paint, perhaps some updated flooring or more contemporary colour choices, could easily give the home a fresh and modern feel while retaining its existing character.\r\n\r\nAs you enter through the porch, you are welcomed into a spacious hallway, providing access to the downstairs WC and a large, warm and inviting sitting room. The kitchen is a lovely blend of traditional charm and everyday practicality, with plenty of cabinet and storage space. Just off the kitchen is a pantry, offering additional storage for everything from household essentials to all those little extras. And in the adjacent room, we have a fabulous dining room which overlooks the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you'll find four generously proportioned bedrooms and the main family bathroom. All four bedrooms benefit from built-in storage, with two featuring convenient slide-robes. The main bathroom is bright, modern and airy, providing a comfortable and functional space for the whole family.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property continues to impress, with a private and enclosed rear garden featuring mature lawns — an ideal space for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying the outdoors. To the front, there is a private driveway providing off-street parking, while a side garage offers additional storage and convenience. There is also a boiler house to the rear. \r\n\r\nLocation is another key feature of this home. Douglas Village Shopping Centre is just five minutes away, Cork City Centre is approximately a 15-minute drive, and there is easy access to the South Link Road. For commuters and those using public transport, the 220 bus stop is located approximately 450 metres from the front door. Overall, this is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a well-cared-for family home in a highly convenient Douglas location, with excellent potential to add your own personal style and modern touches."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Porch - 1.93m x 0.91m \r\nTiled Flooring\r\n\r\nHallway - 2.15m x 4.16m \r\nTimber Flooring\nRadiator\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC - 1.36m x 1.79m \r\nTwo Piece Suite\nHeated Towel Rail\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 3.63m x 4.23m \r\nCarpet Flooring\nRadiator\nFireplace  \r\n\r\nDining Room - 3.63m x 3.24m \r\nCarpet Flooring\nRadiator\nElectric Fireplace \r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room - 4.24m x 2.48m \r\nLino Flooring\nRadiator\nHob / Oven\nWashing Machine\nDishwasher \r\n\r\nPantry - 1.12m x 1.81m \r\nShelved\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 2.78m x 2.52m \r\nCarpet Flooring\nRadiator\nBuilt in Wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.94m x 3.62m \r\nCarpet Flooring\nRadiator\nBuilt in Wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.63m x 4.01m \r\nCarpet Flooring\nRadiator\nSlide Robes\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.57m x 3.83m \r\nCarpet Flooring\nRadiator\nSlide Robes\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.61m x 2.3m \r\nTiled Flooring\nThree Piece Suite\nElectric Shower\nHeated Towel Rail \r\n\r\nHotpress - 0.92m x 0.75m \r\nShelved\r\n\r\n"
